      "body": "Closing as **evaluation-gated, methodology preserved** (per the issue's own project principle: do not pursue route-fit/2 unless a specific resolution need appears that route-fit/1 + selective fallback cannot solve).\n\nRecorded activation condition for reopening: a measured workload where R4RouteAttentionV1 top-M one-shot selection leaves material unresolved mass (the historical basis: one-shot angular partition resolved only 0.168 of transport mass vs 0.990 with base_gap + selective fallback). Until that appears, route-fit/1 stays the mechanism. The head-to-head lessons (delayed refinement > one-shot; account fallback explicitly; judge on downstream unresolved burden, not key reuse) are captured here for whoever hits that need.",
